WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.334
-Today's Friday.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.767
That's usually when I catch up
with some personal stuff.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:06.400
You know, I check my inbox,
return some e-mails,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.367
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.868
James, can I get some thank-you
note writing music, please?

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:16.868
♪♪

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:20.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:21.934
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.167
-Thank you, December.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.834
Between the World Cup
and The Rockettes,

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:27.100
big month for kicking.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.567
Big month for kicking!

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:33.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.000
♪♪

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Thank you, making snow angels,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.334
for letting me finally do
jumping jacks the way I want --

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:40.767
slowly and lying down.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:44.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:47.434
-Hunh!

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:48.701
♪♪

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:51.734
-Thank you, gingerbread men,
for always dressing like

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.901
you're going to an interview
at Chippendales.

00:00:53.901 --> 00:01:00.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:01.534
♪♪

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:04.167
Thank you, the holidays,
for being the only time

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:07.033
the Billboard Hot 100
features Drake, Nicki Minaj,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.234
and Bing Crosby.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.000
-Hunh!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.901
Wah-chh!

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.133
♪♪

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.200
-Thank you,
"It's a Wonderful Life,"

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.567
for being the heartwarming story

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:21.834
of a man
who yells at his children

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:23.367
before wishing he was dead.

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:29.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:32.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:33.601
-Oh, my God.

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:34.634
♪♪

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:36.334
-Thank you, myrrh,

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.000
for sounding like
the third Wise Man

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.167
forgot a present and just
mumbled something to cover.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.934
Like, "I got you, uh, myrrh."

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.734
[ Applause ]

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:45.467
"I got you what --
What do you mean, what is it?

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:46.734
It's myrrh.
It's myrrh."

00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:48.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.367
-Ch!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:52.434
♪♪

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:54.234
-Thank you,
New Year's resolutions,

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.734
for being
the most roundabout way

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:58.000
to tell everyone you're a mess.
There you have it, everybody!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.801
Those are my thank-you notes.

